      "vision_reason": "This is a batik iket kepala (man's head-cloth) from Surakarta, Central Java — a garment/textile associated with Javanese dress, not jewelry as mislabeled. The purple ground with green modang and batik borders is consistent with Javanese court batik tradition.",
